{"id":"svdx35c2nyzbmavq4jlktyarn","title":"邱园 Hill 1915《植物园历史的与功能》的意象学解读","originalTitle":null,"summary":"1915年，邱园皇家植物园助理园长希尔在密苏里植物园成立25周年纪念文集中发表《植物园的历史与功能》。文章通过意象学四层框架（感知、认知、情感、文化）分析了植物园的发展，指出希尔的文本虽详细记录了植物园的设施与历史，但忽略了访客的感知体验、公众认知、访客情感及文化中的不平等。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=38998&do=blog&id=1560154"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-07T09:21:40.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T14:17:09.682Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-07T14:17:09.682Z","category":"gene-cell","tags":["论文发表","Nature"],"score":34,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"074801ba-1b61-4e0a-ac17-cb252e28b795","title":"1915年邱园希尔植物园论文遭意象学框架批判"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"074801ba-1b61-4e0a-ac17-cb252e28b795","title":"1915年邱园希尔植物园论文遭意象学框架批判"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fG-vXYONow7c","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}